  @compatibility(scipy)
  Equivalent to scipy.special.i1e
  @end_compatibility

    If `x` is a `SparseTensor`, returns
    `SparseTensor(x.indices, tf.math.bessel_i1e(x.values, ...), x.dense_shape)`

